              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamatshumi amathathu lesikhombisa wokuthunjwa kukaJehoyakini inkosi yakoJuda, ngosuku lwamatshumi amabili lesikhombisa lwenyanga yetshumi lambili uEvili‐Merodaki inkosi yaseBabiloni ngomnyaka abekwa ngawo abe yinkosi wakhulula uJehoyakini inkosi yakoJuda entolongweni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakhuluma laye kuhle, wamnika isihlalo esedlula zonke izihlalo zamakhosi ayelaye eBabiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke uJehoyakini wakhumula izigqoko zokubotshwa; insuku zonke zokuphila kwakhe wadla lenkosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
